        "speaker": "Dobermann",
        "content": "..."
    },
    {
        "id": 59,
        "raw": "[name=\"Dobermann\"]  Regardless, we're already too late.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Dobermann",
        "content": "Regardless, we're already too late."
    },
    {
        "id": 60,
        "raw": "[name=\"Dobermann\"]  After all, we're in for some trouble ourselves.",
